% review-categories: racism
% review-findings: "a Chiney banana": Jekyll explains it is a variety, the China banana ("a stout low kind which withstands wind"), but "Chiney" can be heard as a mocking word for Chinese people.
% review-suggestion: Sing "China banana", Jekyll's own word for it in his note, and record the change in the N: line and in review-decision.
% review-decision: published to main on 11 November 2026 with "China banana" sung for Jekyll's printed word in the fourth line (his own name for the variety in his note), recorded in the N: line; %%style mento kept (it plays a waltz in 3/4); still wants a Jamaican culture bearer's hearing; keep correcting here
